message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Rice-Pest Detector: a worked example of building software with AI agents"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Kurt
    family-names: Valcorza
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/kurtvalcorza/rice-pest-detector"
url: "https://www.kaggle.com/models/kurtvalcorza/rice-pest-detector"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
keywords:
  - object-detection
  - onnx
  - rt-detr
  - flutter
  - agriculture
  - ai-agents
  - teaching
abstract: >-
  A teaching demonstration of building software with AI coding agents: an object detector
  that counts rice black bug and white stemborer in light-trap photos, exported to ONNX and
  run in a demonstration Android app. It is not a tool for farmers, it is not validated in the
  field and it is not an official product.
